message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Scout: Can better tools make a cheaper AI model reliable enough for the job?"
abstract: >-
  A controlled case study of whether better data tools let a cheaper Claude model match a more expensive one on
  research tasks over captured job postings. Includes the agent, five tool versions, the evaluation harness, graders
  and every graded attempt.
